                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Disposal of a silencer for a air handling unit with 6700 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger) kg/(m3/h), total weight: 0.024 kg/(m3/h), including a frame construction, casing, silencer baffle with section length 900mm. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam, rock wool as sound-absorbing media.</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
